sequenceDiagram
    participant User as "👤 User"
    participant Frontend as "📱 Frontend"
    participant AuthSession as "🔐 AuthSession"
    participant Server as "🖥️ FastAPI Server"
    participant DB as "🗄️ PostgreSQL"
    participant ChordModel as "🎸 Chord-CNN-LSTM"
    participant YT as "🌐 YouTube / File"

    alt Tải file MP3
        User->>Frontend: Chọn file MP3 từ thiết bị
    else Dán YouTube URL
        User->>Frontend: Dán YouTube URL
        Frontend->>YT: fetch oEmbed preview
        YT-->>Frontend: title + thumbnail
    end

    User->>Frontend: Nhấn "Phân tích"
    Frontend->>Server: POST /api/analyze (multipart)
    Note over Frontend,Server: file: MP3 | youtube_url: URL<br/>Authorization: Bearer token<br/>Timeout: 300s

    alt Nguồn YouTube
        Server->>YT: yt-dlp download + FFmpeg extract MP3
        YT-->>Server: input_audio.mp3
    else Nguồn File
        Server->>Server: Ghi uploaded bytes → input_audio.mp3
    end

    Server->>Server: detect_beats_madmom(input_audio)
    Note over Server: madmom RNNBeatProcessor<br/>→ DBNBeatTrackingProcessor<br/>→ beat_list, bpm

    Server->>ChordModel: run_chord_recognition.py (subprocess)
    Note over Server,ChordModel: uv run python chord_recognition.py<br/>input_audio.mp3 → result_chords.lab
    ChordModel-->>Server: result_chords.lab

    Server->>Server: parse_lab_file() → chords [{start, end, chord}]
    Server->>Server: build_analysis_result()
    Note over Server: estimate_time_signature()<br/>synchronize_chords()<br/>build_grid_alignment_metadata()

    Server->>DB: INSERT dechord_analyses (source_type, bpm, ...)
    Server->>DB: INSERT dechord_analysis_beats (index, chord_label, ...)
    Server->>DB: DELETE old (keep 5 records/user)

    Server-->>Frontend: 200 JSON {chords, beats, bpm, chord_count}
    Frontend->>Frontend: Parse → DechordAnalyzeResult → ResultPage
    Frontend-->>User: Chord timeline + audio player + capo transpose
